OL,3,GNEWSACut to college transport
OL,4,Aunforgivable - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposed cuts to funding for post-16
OL,7,Ftransport for pupils would be
OL,8,F"unforgivable" and risk discouraging
OL,9,Fteens from continuing in education, a
OL,10,Fcouncillor has warned.
OL,12,FNorfolk County Council has been
OL,13,Fconsulting on changing its
OL,14,Fsubsidisation of transport for students
OL,15,Ftravelling to and from sixth form or
OL,16,Fcollege.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
