OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACut to college transport
OL,4,Aunforgivable - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FWendy Atkinson, the cabinet member for
OL,7,Fchildren on the Reform UK-led council,
OL,8,Fsaid the current bill of #8m was
OL,9,F"unsustainable" and that cuts to the
OL,10,Fdiscretionary service needed to be
OL,11,Fmade.
OL,13,FMaxine Webb, the leader of the Green
OL,14,Fgroup on the authority, said: "Anything
OL,15,Fthat makes it harder for young people
OL,16,Fto get on in life and have choices is
OL,17,Fjust unforgivable in my opinion."
